@attribute [Route(GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Roadmap)]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Page_Title_Overview_Roadmap</PageTitle>

<div class="info-box info-box--coloured">

    <h1>@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Roadmap</h1>

    <p>
        Currently the following components are in the pipeline with the <b>Busy Indicator</b> and <b>Modal Dialog Framework</b> scheduled to be finalised and released after
        the <b>Core</b> project has been delivered.
    </p>
    <p>
        Then in no particular order the following components will be worked on. Please note all of the components will be fully functional, but may not have all the bells
        and whistles that paid-for components or component frameworks may have.
    </p>
    <p>
        I am focusing on accessibility and inclusivity but I will do my best to add any missing feature that the majority request. I apologise if you are a minority feature
        requester, but I can only do so much in the time I have and I would prefer to reach as wide an audience as I can first, then perhaps later refine things.
    </p>
</div>
<div class="info-box">
    <h3 id="planned-components" class="info-box__heading">Planned Components</h3>

    <ul aria-labelledby="planned-components">
        <li>
            Accordion
        </li>
        <li>
            DataTable
        </li>
        <li>
            DropDownMenuButton
        </li>
        <li>
            Inputs
        </li>
        <li>
            Pager
        </li>
        <li>
            SkipToContent
        </li>
        <li>
            StarRating
        </li>
        <li>
            Switch
        </li>
        <li>
            TabControl
        </li>
        <li>
            TextDebounce
        </li>
        <li>
            ToggleTip
        </li>
        <li>
            ToolTip
        </li>
        <li>
            TreeView
        </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        You are welcome to request a feature and/or a component that you feel should be on the list. To do so just visit the <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/BlazorRamp/Components/issues">Issues (opens in a new window)</a>
        section of the repo and from the new issue select the 'Feature request' option.
    </p>

</div>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Accessibility">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Accessibility</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Theming_Overview">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Theming_Overview</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>